ion that holds me.\nMy prayer is the test for many a\nmasked evil that seeks to seduce me.\nMy prayer will be like a drop of poi\nson on scorpion-it will kill the sin\non the instant. We shall conquer as\nwe go into battle as the Puritans did\nwith the old psalm upon their lips:\n\"Let God arise, and let his enemies\nbe scattered\" five would build a\nholy character on holy faith it must\nbe done with the help of prayer in\nthe Holy Ghost.\n\n=== 5_1887-09-15_p3_sn87091048_00414213030_1887091501_0165.json\nNevada County picayune. · 1887-09-15\ncrops: cached\nheadline: \n---\n[ Mir. B., F. Amonette, Jr., has been enumerating the school chil-\n\n dren in this school district, with i the following result: White males, i. l9S; white females. 206; colored\n\n males, ll9; cOlored females, l22;\n\n total enumeration 64J. This is an\n\n increase Of2l .Over last year. Mir. | X. has our thanks for the in-\n\n formation given. ..a ss44. - td The ladies of c. P. Church will\n\n have a supper at the Court House , enclosure on Friday evening, Sept. 1 18th, the proceeds to be used in\n\n purchasing a bell. Most cordially are the people of town and sur\n\n rounding country invited to come and give it their hearty support.\n\n Supper served from : to 10 P. NJ. Admission lOcts, Supper 25cts. s,. ie Read carefully our extracts on 1st page, which will convince you that Jefferson wanted no fiat pa\n\n per money. In last quotation he\n\n saysi'paper money is poverty, it I.is only the ghost of money.' Also\n\n read our editorial entitled \"Paper\n\n Money\" which will convince you that paper money is what Jcffer.\n\n son says it is ---and it would bank.\n\n rupt;any people. aa H9u t 1 The Gazette of Sunday stated that Bush, (Clerk) and the Thom-\n\n assons of Murfreesboro, got into a\n\n shooting scrape in which w. B.\n\n Thomasson Jr, was fatally wound\n\n ed by Bush and Busl, was also\n\n shot but not seriously. We learn the Gazette's report was incorrect;\n\n that Bob ThomassUn was wou