he two runs of the script, the parse rate and Gemma's above all, so Phase 2A re-measures at scale before it sets the concurrency.\n- Disk: free space dropped between the two runs because macOS swap grew while Gemma loaded. Don't run Gemma during the ingest.\n- Before any session is published, redact another local account's process list from this phase's Entire logs (step 1.7's note).\n\n## Setup before Phase 1 (2026-10-29)\n\n- The private GitHub repo `Hotragn/Paperghosts` is cloned here.\n- `.gitignore` covers `.env` and keeps `Docs/IDEAS.md` private.\n- `.env` holds the keys, never displayed. The SerpApi and Ultramarine keys are set too; the Ultramarine one is named `PAPERINSTRUMENTS_API_KEY` (decision 12).\n- Entire session capture is enabled for Claude Code in this repo only. Checkpoints sync to `origin` on push.\n- Sentry: projects `paperghosts-api` (Python/FastAPI) and `paperghosts-web` (React) exist in org `hotragn`. Their DSNs are `SENTRY_DSN` and `SENTRY_DSN_WEB`, and an auth token with read access is in `.env`. The GitHub repo is linked in Sentry.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"a4b1e899-1b18-4665-9537-fddb0f9ea83d","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2c-reader","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","platfor