{"parentUuid":"8c729813-0a7c-4a28-837c-8e76042c7a83","isSidechain":false,"promptId":"775e54ef-6487-4f79-8598-643421b87718","type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01GUFnD8ypYXbfXTr2ShETrY","type":"tool_result","content":"# Resume\n\nWhere the build stands, for whoever picks it up next. The spec is `BRIEF.md`, the build order is `BUILD-PLAN.md`, and the reasons behind each choice are in `DECISIONS.md`. Each milestone ends with a STATUS block below, newest first.\n\nHard date: the site must be live on Oct 31.\n\n## Next step\n\n**Phase 2C: the reader** (`BUILD-PLAN.md` section 4), on `phase-2c-reader`. Step 2C.1 has designed and drawn the gold set (decision 37): `POLICY.md`, then `eval/gold/split.json` and `HASH`, split from the training pool by the most inclusive grouping and a whole-text check, which `scripts/check_leakage.py` runs.\n- Next, 2C.2: label gold and dev by hand in `scripts/label_gold.py`'s page, before any model output, with a blind second pass on gold to measure agreement. Then freeze them. No label is made before the EM's review of 2C.1.\n- Lexicon v2 keeps all five rules (decision 31).\n\nNeeds the owner's yes when we get there:\n- the Render deploy\n- domain DNS\n\n## STATUS: Phase 2B, schemas and data layer (2026-10-30)\n\nBranch `phase-2b-data-layer`, in four steps, each reviewed by the EM; one PR into `main` at the end.","is_error":false}]},"uuid":"614d9215-892a-40d7-aab1-690a499b221d","timestamp":"2026-10-31T08:48:26.979Z","toolUseResult":{"stdout":"# Resume\n\nWhere the build stands, for whoever picks it up next. The spec is `BRIEF.md`, the build order is `BUILD-PLAN.md`, and the reasons behind each choice are in `DECISIONS.md`. Each milestone ends with a STATUS block below, newest first.\n\nHard date: the site must be live on Oct 31.\n\n## Next step\n\n**Phase 2C: the reader** (`BUILD-PLAN.md` section 4), on `phase-2c-reader`. Step 2C.1 has designed and drawn the gold set (decision 37): `POLICY.md`, then `eval/gold/split.json` and `HASH`, split from the training pool by the most inclusive grouping and a whole-text check, which `scripts/check_leakage.py` runs.\n- Next, 2C.2: label gold and dev by hand in `scripts/label_gold.py`'s page, before any model output, with a blind second pass on gold to measure agreement. Then freeze them. No label is made before the EM's review of 2C.1.\n- Lexicon v2 keeps all five rules (decision 31).\n\nNeeds the owner's yes when we get there:\n- the Render deploy\n- domain DNS\n\n## STATUS: Phase 2B, schemas and data layer (2026-10-30)\n\nBranch `phase-2b-data-layer`, in four steps, each reviewed by the EM; one PR into `main` at the end.","stderr":"","interrupted":false,"isImage":false,"noOutputExpected":false},"serverClassifierContext":{"request":"a1990afb-1238-4158-b2f7-3e902e4f269a","context":{"git_state":{"cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","root":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","branch":"phase-2c-reader","default_branch":null,"status":{"clean":true,"counts":{"staged":0,"modified":0,"untracked":null,"untracked_normal":0},"porcelain":null,"truncated":false},"visibility":{"origin":{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"},"push_remote":"origin","remotes":[{"name":"origin","host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}],"visibility_cache":[{"host":"github.com","remote":"Hotragn/Paperghosts","visibility":"private"}]}},"live_cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","platform":"macos"}},"sandboxed":false,"sourceToolAssistantUUID":"8c729813-0a7c-4a28-837c-8e76042c7a83","permissionDecision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reasonType":"classifier"},"userType":"external","entrypoint":"claude-desktop","cwd":"/Users/hotragn/Documents/Claude Code/HacktoberFest/week4/Paperghosts","sessionId":"1f5be3b0-ab69-4299-a8b5-d7494c65687b","version":"2.1.309","gitBranch":"phase-2c-r